<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 3.03 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 3.03 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury</p>
<p>Office's T-Bill auction February 18 versus February 11:</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p>Maturity, days  84/No bids  176/No bids  358/365</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   accepted    accepted     3.26/3.30</p>
<p> Highest yld					3.26/3.30</p>
<p> Lowest  yld					3.26/3.30</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million   nil	  nil	   3,025/4,360</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    366/2,935  439/715     6,800/5,110</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 44,453 million markka, the STO said. @</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240</p>
</text>
